# Oracle feeder for Paxeer X Network (image built from services/platform/hosted/feeder/Dockerfile,
# context = repository root). Price pushes require EIP-1559 transactions to
# 0x1015 pushOracle(bytes,bytes), encoded with
# layerx_crypto::evm_transaction::Eip1559Call and submitted through the unified
# router's eth_sendRawTransaction. The oracle key file is mode 0600 under keys/.
LAYERX_FEEDER_CONFIG=/data/feeder.json
LAYERX_FEEDER_ORACLE_KEY_FILE=/data/keys/oracle.key
LAYERX_FEEDER_STATE_DIR=/data/state
# The EVM sender must be the oracle key's 0x1004-bound address.
# Plain listener: GET /healthz (process up) and GET /readyz (last round fresh).
LAYERX_HEALTH_ADDR=[::]:8080
